+**The positive control (registered).** LMCap's text generator never sees the image, so the image reaches it only through the retrieved captions and the re-ranking of its beams. Replacing the retrieved captions with random ones should therefore lower its score. It did: +16.92 [15.00, 19.06] (p̃ = 1/2,001, its floor), DETECTED. The positive control was met. This is the first look at this contrast; the `lmcap_ri` level on this set had been seen in the exploration runs of the Flickr30K registration (no number of those runs is used here).
